"26\">THE STOIC MOVE</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"840\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Withhold assent at step 2</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"880\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">Step 3 cannot follow</text><rect x=\"200\" y=\"950\" width=\"700\" height=\"60\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"990\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"22\">Your disturbance is your assent.</text></svg>",
      "caption": "How the mind makes disturbance"
