      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">LETTER 91: LYON BURNS</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">64 CE — a city in one night</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"190\" width=\"900\" height=\"180\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"245\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"26\">THE EVENT</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"295\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Lugdunum destroyed</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"335\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">Liberalis watches it burn</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"390\" width=\"900\" height=\"160\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.12)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"160\" y=\"440\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">1.</text><text x=\"210\" y=\"440\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Nothing material is permanent</text><text x=\"210\" y=\"480\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Cities fall. So do fortunes.</text><text x=\"210\" y=\"515\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">\"What towers must fall.\"</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"570\" width=\"900\" height=\"160\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.12)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"160\" y=\"620\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">2.</text><text x=\"210\" y=\"620\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">The mind is the only fortress</text><text x=\"210\" y=\"660\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Virtue, integrity, friendship</text><text x=\"210\" y=\"695\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">— fire cannot reach these</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"750\" width=\"900\" height=\"160\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"160\" y=\"800\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">3.</text><text x=\"210\" y=\"800\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Practice the fall in advance</text><text x=\"210\" y=\"840\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">\"What if I lost my city today?\"</text><text x=\"210\" y=\"875\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">— then walk out free</text><rect x=\"200\" y=\"940\" width=\"700\" height=\"60\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"980\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"22\">Fortune was a tenant, not an owner.</text></svg>",
      "caption": "Three movements in Letter 91"
