"210\" y=\"670\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Performative virtue</text><text x=\"210\" y=\"710\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Letter 5 made current</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"760\" width=\"900\" height=\"120\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.12)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"160\" y=\"810\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">5.</text><text x=\"210\" y=\"810\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Declining religious frame</text><text x=\"210\" y=\"850\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Non-theological memento mori</text><rect x=\"200\" y=\"910\" width=\"700\" height=\"80\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"960\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"22\">A 2,000-year answer that fits.</text></svg>",
